# Object import — act without asking when known

When the user asks to import/replace an object and the data is clear:

- Pick the next free export ID in the target `o_*.swf` pack without asking.
- If the filename has `refN`, or Library has a same-size object, use that anchor.
- If several same-size refs exist, prefer the first/lowest ID (or the named `refN`).
- Only ask when something is ambiguous (bad/empty SVG, conflicting sizes, missing files, or no reasonable anchor).

After a successful import/replace/delete of objects: restart RufusAdmin (see open-rufus-admin rule).
